post.summary:
Takes the newest image under the tag a container runs, in a job: its
project is pulled and brought up again, as the scheduled update does;
outside a project the image is only fetched. Needs `containers.manage`.

MetricsHistory.description:
The last minutes of the host's load as series for charts, oldest first;
one sample every two seconds, at most six minutes. Rates are summed over
all network interfaces and all disks.
